# Office photographs are per-deployment and the ones this was built against are
# watermarked stock comps. See client/src/assets/offices/README.md. The wider
# pattern covers the staging area above offices/ too, so a photo dropped in
# to try out cannot be committed by an absent-minded `git add -A`.
client/src/assets/**/*.jpg
client/src/assets/*.jpg
